  Possibly planted project folders

  These folders appeared while a Windows sandbox command ran, so a command may have planted them.
  Corbanu Terminal isn't loading their config, hooks or skills:
    project/.codex

  These git folders appeared or changed while a Windows sandbox command ran, so a command may have
  planted them. Git runs their hooks and config outside the sandbox whenever you run git there:
    project/.git
  Check their contents (for a .git, its hooks and config) before you load or confirm them.

› 1. Keep ignoring them  Ask again next time
  2. Load them           I checked them; load them from the next start

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
